## Request

Add the smallest complete project-configurable release-identity contract. Extend the existing
repository policy surface with strict SemVer as the unchanged default and one bounded fixed-width
dotted-numeric profile sufficient for `v00.05.00`; reject arbitrary regex and executable hooks.

Centralize tag eligibility, exact identity preservation, Git reachability, usable finalized-cohort
predecessor preference, deterministic bootstrap fallback, normalized-alias ambiguity, and
actionable rejection diagnostics. Route every release-cohort operation through that evaluator.
Treat completed PRM-0044 as historical regression evidence and do not reopen or rewrite it.

Stop after focused implementation proof, strict Doctor, configured development-lane verification,
the exact Work2 candidate registration, and a durable Hybrid checkpoint. Do not publish, tag,
release, close GitHub issues, or begin M2 in this campaign.

